{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Last Pickup&quot;</strong> is a game of survival and adventure in a post-apocalyptic world where players deliver vital supplies under challenging circumstances. Navigate through the ruins of a desolate city in your vehicle, solving puzzles, overcoming obstacles, and ensuring precise delivery of essential items. A lack of fuel or loss of supplies will send you back to the starting point, demanding careful driving and strategic decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo version, you can play through portions of Episode 1 and Episode 2, offering a glimpse into the thrilling combination of survival tension and racing excitement. Experience the adrenaline of racing against the odds in a world on the brink!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449120?t=1737085768","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1737085768","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449120/15dcda17790306793d93f9c59e7ad540946435ac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1737085768","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449120/15dcda17790306793d93f9c59e7ad540946435ac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1737085768","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Last Pickup&quot;</strong> is a game of survival and adventure in a post-apocalyptic world where players deliver vital supplies under challenging circumstances. Navigate through the ruins of a desolate city in your vehicle, solving puzzles, overcoming obstacles, and ensuring precise delivery of essential items. A lack of fuel or loss of supplies will send you back to the starting point, demanding careful driving and strategic decision-making.</